 "notModeled": [
  "analog input, internal / external reference (REFEN), RBIAS",
  "conversions are paced by the external CLK (one word per 8 CLK, per 4 CLK in 2X mode); the model runs them free at the nominal fCLK = 40 MHz (200 ns, 100 ns in 2X mode) from power-on and does not need CLK",
  "DRDY: a square wave in the real part (low 4 t1, high 4 t1); modeled as a low pulse of 100 ns (4 CLK at 40 MHz) after each conversion; the 2X-mode pulse width is not given in the data sheet (50 ns used); RESET forcing DRDY high / DOUT low, and the 47-cycle settling after reset",
  "OTR stays low (in-range 0 V input); FIFO_LEV[2:0] are ADS1606-only pins (must be left unconnected on the ADS1605: role nc)",
  "the 2XMODE and PD internal pull resistors (a floating pin reads inactive / 0 in the model)"
